  "title": {
   "en": "Zecchou Skill \"Onsen Souzou\" de Yukemuri Harem wo Kizuku made ~Hensei ga Todokottara Soku Dorei no Isekai Tensei! Akaji Ryokan Saiken Keikaku~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "絶頂スキル【温泉創造】で湯けむりハーレムを築くまで～返済が滞ったら即奴隷の異世界転生！赤字旅館再建計画～（コミック）"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Zecchou Skill \"Onsen Souzou\" de Yukemuri Harem o Kizuku made ~Hensei ga Todokottara Soku Dorei no Isekai Tensei! Akaji Ryokan Saiken Keikaku~"
   },
   {
    "en": "Climax Skill \"Onsen Creation\": Building a Steamy Harem – Reincarnated into Another World with Instant Slavery for Missed Payments! Reviving a Debt-Ridden Inn"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Former ryokan (Japanese inn) worker, Jin Tono, is reincarnated into a fantasy world with a cheat skill! Excited for his first adventure, he encounters a slime, only to find it shockingly strong! Desperate, he tries to use his cheat ability, but all he can do is produce hot water from his hands?! With zero combat power, Jin is on the verge of death, until a passing female adventurer, Oraria, saves him. In exchange, he swears to do anything she asks. Little does Jin know... He just made a deal with the wrong person. His \"hot water\" skill isn't useless—it's actually... insanely overpowered?!",
   "ja": "チート能力を授かり、現代から異世界へと転生した元旅館従業員の遠野ジン。初めての異世界にワクワクなジンの前に早速スライムくんが１stエンカウント。可愛らしい見た目と違ってめちゃつよ攻撃を繰り出すスライムくんにチート能力で抵抗を試みるが、ただただ手のひらからお湯が出るだけで完全ノーダメージ!? 大ピンチのジンは、偶然通りかかった女冒険者・オラリアに「なんでも言うことを聞くから！」と乞い、命からがら助けてもらう。しかしこの時ジンは知らなかった──助けてもらった相手を間違ったこと、そして授かったスキルの本当の能力に…！ 誰でもイカせる絶頂スキル【温泉創造】で赤字旅館を再建させろ!? ちょっぴりエッチな異世界ハーレムファンタジー開幕ッ！"
  },
